{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Protect the Kittenpire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cats\u2019 ancient nemesis - the mice - have grown into towering giants after a potion experiment went terribly wrong.<br>Defend the Kittenpire from colossal mouse monsters across <strong>7 unique biomes</strong> and <strong>65 challenging stages</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Deploy your Paws!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your purr-fect squad from <strong>28 upgradable characters</strong>, <strong>2 mighty heroes</strong>, and <strong>3 special ability units</strong>.<br>Strategically place them to hold back the endless mouse invasion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Upgrade their Fluff!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character can be upgraded through <strong>5 power levels</strong>.<br>Heroes and special units feature their own <strong>skill trees</strong>, so you can sharpen claws, boost whiskers, and prepare for every challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Conquer the Mouse Monsters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>40 enemy types</strong> and <strong>5 epic bosses</strong>.<br>Looking for a cozy catnap or a real claw-biting challenge?<br>Pick from <strong>3 difficulty levels</strong> to suit your mood.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546930?t=1759241278","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546930?t=1759241278","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/f14eb9feb586157565c6805d92005cfe05afbb1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759241278","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/f14eb9feb586157565c6805d92005cfe05afbb1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759241278","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},